    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23104" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυρ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make round,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρανόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Si.</u>
					43.12
				</span></i>
			; <i>bend,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				2.333
			</span></i>; <i>wind,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίχα ἵππου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHolm.</u>
					3.42
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γήρ-</span> Pap.); <i>bind up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				4.419
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ αὐχένι δεσμὰ βραχίοσι
			γ.</span> of a bride, ib. <i><span class="en">
				159
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be bent</i>: hence of the aged, <i>to be
			weak</i> in body, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				969
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>plant in a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῦρος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.294
			</span></i>; <i>make a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῦρος</span>
			<i>round</i> a tree, ib.<i><span class="en">
				402
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				4.3.1
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>dig, trench,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βώλακα γαίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					514
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> intr.,
				<i>coil oneself up,</i> of the ichneumon, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				3.440
			</span></i>.</div>
